title: "Is Chain-of-Thought Just Rationalization? A Mechanistic Faithfulness Audit of LLM Reasoning"
authors:
  - family-names: Ballhaus
    given-names: Brooke
  - family-names: Narain
    given-names: Riya
date-released: 2026-06-08
